{
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "You decided. I followed the glowing footprints.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l00.wav",
   "dur": 2.773375,
   "start": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Into the forest. At three in the morning. In my pajamas. Great idea, everyone.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l01.wav",
   "dur": 5.152375,
   "start": 3.453375
  },
  {
   "text": "The footprints glowed blue. And they were small. Kid sized.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l02.wav",
   "dur": 3.819292,
   "start": 8.98575
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I noticed something. They looked exactly like my slippers.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l03.wav",
   "dur": 3.19225,
   "start": 13.185042
  },
  {
   "text": "Bunny slippers. With ears. Don't laugh.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l04.wav",
   "dur": 2.696083,
   "start": 16.757292
  },
  {
   "text": "An owl looked down at me and said: Whooo?",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l05.wav",
   "dur": 2.879271,
   "start": 19.833375
  },
  {
   "text": "I said: Me. I think.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l06.wav",
   "dur": 1.990938,
   "start": 23.092646000000002
  },
  {
   "text": "The footprints stopped in a clearing.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l07.wav",
   "dur": 1.601875,
   "start": 25.463584
  },
  {
   "text": "And right in the middle stood a mailbox. In the forest. Glowing green.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l08.wav",
   "dur": 4.061917,
   "start": 27.445459
  },
  {
   "text": "My name was written on it. Pip.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l09.wav",
   "dur": 1.821542,
   "start": 31.887376
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside were two letters.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l10.wav",
   "dur": 1.328167,
   "start": 34.088918
  },
  {
   "text": "The first one said: Hi Pip. It's me. You. From tomorrow.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l11.wav",
   "dur": 3.574729,
   "start": 35.797085
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't trust the letters from the town. They are lying.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l12.wav",
   "dur": 2.968417,
   "start": 39.751814
  },
  {
   "text": "My knees were shaking. Then I heard footsteps behind me.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l13.wav",
   "dur": 3.311167,
   "start": 43.100231
  },
  {
   "text": "Crunch. Crunch. Crunch.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l14.wav",
   "dur": 1.715688,
   "start": 46.791398
  },
  {
   "text": "And the footsteps were glowing blue.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l15.wav",
   "dur": 1.613938,
   "start": 48.887086000000004
  },
  {
   "text": "Option one. Turn around.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l16.wav",
   "dur": 1.511708,
   "start": 50.881024000000004
  },
  {
   "text": "Option two. Run home as fast as I can.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l17.wav",
   "dur": 3.193917,
   "start": 52.772732000000005
  },
  {
   "text": "Option three. Open the second letter.",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l18.wav",
   "dur": 2.237708,
   "start": 56.346649000000006
  },
  {
   "text": "Comment one, two, or three. Hurry. The footsteps are getting closer!",
   "file": "folge02/audio_clone/l19.wav",
   "dur": 4.272729,
   "start": 58.96435700000001
  }
 ],
 "total": 66.617086
}